 *
 *
 * Accounting
 * ----------
 *
 * [x] Release conserves balance
 * [x] Refund conserves balance
 * [x] No duplicate payment
 * [x] Multiple escrows isolated
 *
 *
 * State Machine
 * -------------
 *
 * [x] Created -> Funded
 * [x] Created -> Cancelled
 * [x] Funded -> Released
 * [x] Funded -> Refunded
 *
 * [x] Released -> Funded      BLOCKED
 * [x] Released -> Refunded    BLOCKED
 * [x] Refunded -> Released    BLOCKED
 * [x] Refunded -> Funded      BLOCKED
 * [x] Cancelled -> Funded     BLOCKED
